   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Se considera la función \\(f:[1,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\sqrt{x^2-x}+x\\). Determina la asíntota de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Vertical:</b> \\(f\\) es continua en \\([1,+\\infty)\\) (\\(x^2-x\\geq0\\) ahí): no tiene.</p><p><b>Horizontal:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=+\\infty\\): no tiene. (Solo hay que estudiar \\(+\\infty\\), por el dominio.)</p><p><b>Oblicua </b>\\(y=mx+n\\)<b>:</b></p>\\[m=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt{x^2-x}+x}x=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{1-\\frac1x}+1\\right)=2\\]\\[n=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2-x}-x\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{(x^2-x)-x^2}{\\sqrt{x^2-x}+x}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{-x}{\\sqrt{x^2-x}+x}=-\\frac12\\]<p>(Multiplico y divido por el conjugado.)</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='76.9,177.1 79.4,172.6 82.0,170.0 84.5,167.7 87.0,165.6 89.6,163.5 92.1,161.5 94.6,159.6 97.2,157.6 99.7,155.7 102.3,153.8 104.8,151.9 107.3,150.1 109.9,148.2 112.4,146.3 115.0,144.5 117.5,142.7 120.0,140.8 122.6,139.0 125.1,137.2 127.7,135.3 130.2,133.5 132.7,131.7 135.3,129.9 137.8,128.1 140.4,126.2 142.9,124.4 145.4,122.6 148.0,120.8 150.5,119.0 153.0,117.2 155.6,115.4 158.1,113.6 160.7,111.8 163.2,110.0 165.7,108.2 168.3,106.4 170.8,104.6 173.4,102.8 175.9,101.0 178.4,99.2 181.0,97.4 183.5,95.6 186.1,93.8 188.6,92.0 191.1,90.2 193.7,88.4 196.2,86.6 198.8,84.8 201.3,83.0 203.8,81.2 206.4,79.4 208.9,77.6 211.4,75.8 214.0,74.0 216.5,72.2 219.1,70.4 221.6,68.7 224.1,66.9 226.7,65.1 229.2,63.3 231.8,61.5 234.3,59.7 236.8,57.9 239.4,56.1 241.9,54.3 244.5,52.5 247.0,50.7 249.5,48.9 252.1,47.2 254.6,45.4 257.1,43.6 259.7,41.8 262.2,40.0 264.8,38.2 267.3,36.4 269.8,34.6 272.4,32.8 274.9,31.0 277.5,29.3 280.0,27.5' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='36.2,198.6 158.1,112.9 280.0,27.1' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='76.9' cy='177.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='82.9' y='187.1'>(1,1)</text><g stro