    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A(R_1)=\\int_0^{\\sqrt2}\\left(1-\\frac{x^2}2\\right)dx=\\Bigl[x-\\frac{x^3}6\\Bigr]_0^{\\sqrt2}=\\sqrt2-\\frac{2\\sqrt2}6=\\frac{2\\sqrt2}3\\]<p>El rectángulo tiene área \\(2\\cdot1=2\\):</p>\\[A(R_2)=2-\\frac{2\\sqrt2}3\\]<div class='res'>\\(A(R_1)=\\dfrac{2\\sqrt2}3\\approx0{,}94\\ u^2\\) y \\(A(R_2)=2-\\dfrac{2\\sqrt2}3\\approx1{,}06\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
