  {
   "id": "matematicas-2009-reserva-2-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el punto \\(P(1,0,0)\\), la recta \\(r\\) definida por \\(x-3=\\dfrac y2=\\dfrac{z+1}{-2}\\) y la recta \\(s\\) definida por \\((x,y,z)=(1,1,0)+\\lambda(-1,2,0)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Estudia la posición relativa de \\(r\\) y \\(s\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano que pasando por \\(P\\) es paralelo a \\(r\\) y \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(3,0,-1)\\) con \\(\\vec u=(1,2,-2)\\); \\(s\\) pasa por \\(S(1,1,0)\\) con \\(\\vec v=(-1,2,0)\\). Los directores no son proporcionales: se cortan o se cruzan. Con \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(-2,1,1)\\), por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec u,\\vec v]=\\begin{vmatrix}-2&1&1\\\\1&2&-2\\\\-1&2&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+2+2\\bigr)-\\bigl(-2+8+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-2\\neq0\\]<div class='res'>\\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cruzan</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paralelo a \\(r\\) y a \\(s\\): su normal es perpendicular a \\(\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec v\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec u\\times\\vec v=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&2&-2\\\\-1&2&0\\end{vmatrix}=(4,\\,2,\\,4)\\parallel(2,1,2)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(2x+y+2z+D=0\\) y pasa por \\(P(1,0,0)\\): \\(2+D=0\\iff D=-2\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":177,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-1.426,1.958,1.447],[0.311,-1.516,1.447],[2.626,-0.358,-1.447],[0.889,3.116,-1.447]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[2.626,-0.358,-1.447],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[2,-2,1],[4,2,-3],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[4,2,-3],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[2,-1,0],[0,3,0],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0,3,0],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"pt\",[1,0,0],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 245' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m09r2a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m09r2a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m09r2a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m09r2a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='98.8,71.9 291.5,30.9 218.6,135.9 26.0,176.8' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='222.6' y='135.9' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='314.0' y1='18.0' x2='80.2' y2='191.3' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='86.2' y='191.3' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='257.1' y1='72.0' x2='35.2' y2='119.1' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='41.2' y='119.1' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><circle cx='203.1' cy='94.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='210.1' y='88.4' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='23.2' y2='209.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='19.9' y='210.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='8.0' y2='215.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.6' y='219.4' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='24.0' y2='200.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='199.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,237)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,237)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,237)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(260.5,237)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(2x+y+2z-2=0\\)</div></div>"
